@startuml optihus-ibd-pi1
title IBD — Pi 1 (datahaandtering) interne forbindelser
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "TcpServer\n:kTcpPort" as TCP
queue "inbound_queue" as IQ
queue "outbound_queue" as OQ
queue "telemetry_queue" as TQ
component "datahaandtering::App\n(wait_pop + handle_message)" as APP
component "TelemetryProcessor\n(thread)" as TP
component "WebUiServer\n:kHttpUiPort" as WEB
component "CommandDispatcher" as CMD
component "ConfigManager" as CFG
component "DatabaseManager" as DBM
database "optihus.db" as DB
actor "Browser" as BR
component "miljoestyring\nTcpClient" as P2

P2 <--> TCP : JSON-line socket
TCP --> IQ
IQ --> APP
APP --> TP : enqueue Telemetry\n(Hello → dispatch_current_config)
TP --> DBM
TP ..> WEB : note_field_live\n(field_live)
APP ..> CMD : Hello path
WEB --> DBM
WEB --> CFG
WEB --> CMD : gem konfig
CMD --> OQ
OQ --> TCP
CFG --> DBM
DBM --> DB
BR --> WEB : HTTP

note right of APP
  **Hello:** command_dispatcher_.dispatch_current_config()\n→ outbound → Pi 2
  **Telemetry:** telemetry_queue_.push → TP → insert_telemetry;\nTP → WEB.field_node (sidste Pi 2 komponent‑JSON)
end note

@enduml


@startuml optihus-ibd-pi2
title IBD — Pi 2 (miljoestyring) interne forbindelser
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "datahaandtering\nTcpServer (Pi 1)" as P1
component "TcpClient" as TC
queue "inbound\nThreadSafeQueue" as IQ
component "miljoestyring::App\n(hovedløkke)" as APP
component "ControlManager" as CM
component "ClientRuntimeState" as RT
component "SensorManager" as SM
component "Motor\n(thread)" as M
component "PlantBox\n(thread)" as PB
component "DHT22\n(sysfs IIO)" as DHT
component "Vindue\n(stepper gpiod)" as WIN
component "ADS/I2C\n/dev/i2c-1 0x48" as I2C
component "Pumpe\npinctrl GPIO" as PUMP
storage "Persistens\n(/var/lib/optihus\neller OPTIHUS_STATE_DIR)" as ST

P1 <--> TC : TCP JSON-lines
TC --> IQ
APP ..> ST : ved boot:\nreplay set_config
CM ..> ST : gem params +\nnødstop-overlay
APP ..> IQ : try_pop (drain)
APP --> CM : apply_inbound_message
CM --> RT
CM --> M
CM --> PB
APP --> SM : read_sample
SM --> M
SM --> PB
SM --> TC : send_telemetry\n(+ valgfri field_live)
M --> DHT
M --> WIN : pins fra **board_pins.hpp**
PB --> I2C
PB --> PUMP : fx GPIO **16**

note bottom of ST
  **miljoestyring_field_config.json**\n(version 2, atomisk skrivning)
end note

note bottom of DHT
  Læser **/sys/bus/iio/devices/\niio:device0/in_*_input**
  (ikke valgt via gpio_pin i update()).
end note

@enduml


@startuml optihus-domain-contexts
